{"q":"98","t":"Validate Binary Search Tree","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>root</code> of a binary tree, <em>determine if it is a valid binary search tree (BST)</em>.</p>\n\n<p>A <strong>valid BST</strong> is defined as follows:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The left <span data-keyword=\"subtree\">subtree</span> of a node contains only nodes with keys&nbsp;<strong>strictly less than</strong> the node&#39;s key.</li>\n\t<li>The right subtree of a node contains only nodes with keys <strong>strictly greater than</strong> the node&#39;s key.</li>\n\t<li>Both the left and right subtrees must also be binary search trees.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/bff96c2229b918de.jpg\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 182px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [2,1,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> true\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/d5ba1a7081cf4bd8.jpg\" style=\"width: 422px; height: 292px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> root = [5,1,4,null,null,3,6]\n<strong>Output:</strong> false\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The root node&#39;s value is 5 but its right child&#39;s value is 4.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the tree is in the range <code>[1, 10<sup>4</sup>]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-2<sup>31</sup> &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup> - 1</code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"isValidBST\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"root\",\r\n      \"type\": \"TreeNode\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"boolean\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Tree","slug":"tree"},{"name":"Depth-First Search","slug":"depth-first-search"},{"name":"Binary Search Tree","slug":"binary-search-tree"},{"name":"Binary Tree","slug":"binary-tree"}],"s":[{"t":"Binary Tree Inorder Traversal","s":"binary-tree-inorder-traversal","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Find Mode in Binary Search Tree","s":"find-mode-in-binary-search-tree","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Citadel","citadel"],["Lyft","lyft"],["IBM","ibm"],["Millennium","millennium"],["Salesforce","salesforce"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Apple","apple"],["Wix","wix"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",4],["Microsoft","microsoft",3],["Google","google",2],["Meta","facebook",2],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"b":[],"m":[["Oracle","oracle",4],["IBM","ibm",3],["Apple","apple",3],["Salesforce","salesforce",3],["LinkedIn","linkedin",2],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",2],["Citadel","citadel",2],["Yahoo","yahoo",2],["Millennium","millennium",2],["Expedia","expedia",2]]}}